==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* (''dated'') {{l|is|gjöra}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈcɛːra/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛːra|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|gerði|gert}}

# {{transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[do]]{{jump|is|do|s}}
#: ''Hvað ertu að '''gera'''?''
#:: What are you '''doing'''?
#: ''Letingjar '''gera''' aldrei neitt.''
#:: Loafers never '''do''' anything.
# {{transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[make]]{{jump|is|make|d|s}}
# to [[arbitrate]], to [[determine]]{{jump|is|arbitrate|d|s}}
# {{context|impersonal|lang=is}}
#: ''Það '''gerði''' rigningu.''
#:: It '''rained'''.

